stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> queued : 接单排队
    queued --> working : 派工启动 · 占槽
    working --> idle : 报 waiting · 本轮结束
    idle --> working : 订阅消息 / 后台完成唤醒
    working --> review : 报 ready · PR 待人审
    working --> answer : 提问 human_action
    answer --> working : 答后继续（授权工作不停）
    working --> blocked : 报 blocked/failed
    blocked --> working : 人话释放 · 重试
    idle --> ended : dropped 无事可做
    review --> ended : PR 合并/关闭 · followsDone
    ended --> working : 真人消息复活 · 先重验票据
    review --> [*]
    ended --> [*]
